{"timestamp":"2025-08-31T06:51:48.116Z","level":"INFO","message":"Updated translation: 110635","file":"browser_init","function":"Session.<anonymous>","line":"2","details":{"oldTranslatedText":"You are responsible for what you post in the game. Rules apply everywhere, including Chat, Forums & Private Messages.[br][br]---[br]Any violation of these rules will result in a temporarily [b]Ban[/b]:[br][br]1. ENGLISH everywhere except the Chat rooms for other languages as designated, or in Private Messages.[br][br]2. No Chat Drama, Trolling, or Threats.[br][br]3. No Racism, Politics, Religion, Gay bashing, Sexual harrasment, Antisemitism (or any type of religious intolerance), excessive Taunting or Name-calling.[br][br]4. No Swearing or Inappropriate names (sexual, obscene, drug or racist) including the titles on equipped items.[br][br]5. No Abbreviated and/or letter substitution for swear words in Chat, Forums or Private Messages.[br][br]6. No Buying/Selling/Giving/Trading in any Chat, except Marketplace or Clan Chat.[br][br]7. No Flooding and/or Spamming in Chat or Forums.[br][br]8. No Pornographic images on profile, includes using letters, numbers or symbols to make pornographic images on profile or on equipped items.[br][br]9. No Posting URLs, links or website addresses in Chat or Forums or on a Player Profile.[br][br]10. No Promoting other games anywhere.[br][br]11. No all caps allowed in any Chat (considered yelling).[br][br]12. No Profile Messages that will stall out cell phones.[br][br]---[br][br]You will immdetiately get [b]Suspended[/b] for breaking any of these rules:[br][br]13. No Account Selling, Sharing, Giving, or Trading.[br][br]14. Selling or Buying Credits from other players for real money (or phone air time, load, etc.) is NOT allowed.[br][br]15. No Automated bots.[br][br]16. No Manipulation of code(s) and/or abuse of glitches.[br][br]17. No Cloning the user name of other players or admin.[br][br]--[br][br]Since it is impossible to foresee all problems in advance in order to address all possible issues in the game rules, few selected players were appointed to act as Moderators.[br][br]There may be times when issues arise that are not covered in the rules, and the Moderators will make decisions on those issues at the time.[br][br]It’s all about having fun! Keep the drama to a minimum and have respect for other Players AND our Moderators.[br][br]Long live [b]Black Dragon RPG[/b]![br][br][i]Thank You,[br]Dreamer[/i]","newTranslatedText":"You are responsible for what you post in the game. Rules apply everywhere, including Chat, Forums & Private Messages.[br][br]---[br]Any violation of these rules will result in a temporarily [b]Ban[/b]:[br][br]1. ENGLISH everywhere except the Chat rooms for other languages as designated, or in Private Messages.[br][br]2. No Chat Drama, Trolling, or Threats.[br][br]3. No Racism, Politics, Religion, Gay bashing, Sexual harrasment, Antisemitism (or any type of religious intolerance), excessive Taunting or Name-calling.[br][br]4. No Swearing or Inappropriate names (sexual, obscene, drug or racist) including the titles on equipped items.[br][br]5. No Abbreviated and/or letter substitution for swear words in Chat, Forums or Private Messages.[br][br]6. No Buying/Selling/Giving/Trading in any Chat, except Marketplace or Clan Chat.[br][br]7. No Flooding and/or Spamming in Chat or Forums.[br][br]8. No Pornographic images on profile, includes using letters, numbers or symbols to make pornographic images on profile or on equipped items.[br][br]9. No Posting URLs, links or website addresses in Chat or Forums or on a Player Profile.[br][br]10. No Promoting other games anywhere.[br][br]11. No all caps allowed in any Chat (considered yelling).[br][br]12. No Profile Messages that will stall out cell phones.[br][br]---[br][br]You will immdetiately get [b]Suspended[/b] for breaking any of these rules:[br][br]13. No Account Selling, Sharing, Giving, or Trading.[br][br]14. Selling or Buying Credits from other players for real money (or phone air time, load, etc.) is NOT allowed.[br][br]15. No Automated bots.[br][br]16. No Manipulation of code(s) and/or abuse of glitches.[br][br]17. No Cloning the user name of other players or admin.[br][br]--[br][br]Since it is impossible to foresee all problems in advance in order to address all possible issues in the game rules, few selected players were appointed to act as Moderators.[br][br]There may be times when issues arise that are not covered in the rules, and the Moderators will make decisions on those issues at the time.[br][br]It’s all about having fun! Keep the drama to a minimum and have respect for other Players AND our Moderators.[br][br]Long live [b]Black Dragon RPG[/b]![br][br][i]Thank You,[br]Dreamer[/i]"}}
